     2381   input '' ,
     2382   input xtog-obj) .
     2383      if xshowcrsa or xshowcrsands or use-column[23] or use-column[24]  or xshowmediator   then do:
     2384         if gds-zap-type = 'т':U  then
     2385   run ob-line  in this-procedure (
     2386   input x-store-code ,
